    "parent_id": "587089d3-416b-4238-967a-059b1e09d0d6",
    "content": "# Standard Operating Procedure: Production API Deployment ## 1. Overview and Pre-Deployment Gates\nAll microservices deployed to production Kubernetes clusters must pass automated CI/CD pipeline checks before traffic migration.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "metadata": {
      "doc_id": "2325de45-de5a-4951-9c22-dabab2d1a12d",
      "title": "Engineering API Deployment SOP",
      "department": "engineering",
      "clearance_level": "internal",
      "document_type": "sop",
      "author": "DevOps Architecture Team",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "created_date": "2026-10-17",
      "tags": [
        "sop",
        "internal",
        "api",
        "deployment",
        "kubernetes",
        "engineering"
      ],
      "source_file": "api_deployment_sop.md",
      "allowed_roles": [
        "employee",
        "manager",
        "admin",
        "executive"
      ],
      "extra_attributes": {}
    },
    "character_count": 226,
    "estimated_token_count": 56
  },
  {
    "id": "6ad1b1e5-af36-4e33-9156-2dfba74b5c0a",
    "parent_id": "587089d3-416b-4238-967a-059b1e09d0d6",
    "content": "Prior to initiating a deployment:\n- All unit tests must achieve a minimum of 85% branch coverage. - Vulnerability scans must report zero critical or high severity CVEs. - Load testing must confirm P99 latency remains under 200ms at 1,500 RPS. ## 2.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "metadata": {
      "doc_id": "2325de45-de5a-4951-9c22-dabab2d1a12d",
      "title": "Engineering API Deployment SOP",
