    "content": "# Production Error Codes & Incident Severity Matrix ## 1. Incident Severity Definitions and SLAs\n- **Severity P1 (Critical Outage):** Core payment processing or user authentication down. SLA Response Time: 15 minutes. Escalation: VP of Engineering and Incident Commander.",
