    "parent_id": "5e4e7e2f-fdcd-4bf6-8ab0-b798dfeb4ef7",
    "content": "- Maximum outperformance (125%+ ARR target): 200% target payout cap. ## 3.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "metadata": {
